      "shortDescription": "FAULHABER develops miniature and micro drive systems for precision motion applications. Its official portfolio combines DC and brushless DC motors, stepper and linear motors, precision gearheads, linear actuators, encoders and speed or motion-control electronics.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "Dr. Fritz Faulhaber GmbH & Co. KG is the German company behind FAULHABER Drive Systems. Founded in 1947, the independent group is headquartered in Schönaich and develops compact drive technology for applications where controlled motion, low weight and small installation dimensions are important.",
        "The documented portfolio covers DC micromotors, brushless DC servomotors, stepper motors, linear DC servomotors, planetary and spur gearheads, direct and geared linear actuators, incremental and absolute encoders, motors with integrated electronics, speed controllers and motion controllers. Official market pages identify aerospace and aviation, industrial and laboratory automation, medical equipment, metrology and testing, motorized hand-held devices, optics and robotics among the application fields for these drive systems."
      ],
